comments.body:
@participant5 Hm, this sounds different from what others here are reporting. Can you write in to our support team at <email-scrubbed>? We can help sort out what you're seeing there.

@participant2 I suspect your issue could be related to a setting or firewall policing `tailscale0` on your DNS resolver node. When your phone switched from wifi to cellular I see the following error after a few moments:

> CreateEndpoint error for (iPhone) -> (DNS node): connection was refused 

Can you check logs on your resolver for more clues? If you'd like to share more information privately, please drop a line at <email-scrubbed>. 

@reporter and all others experiencing issues transitioning from wifi to cellular: we'll be releasing stable version 1.62 soon with a DNS improvement that may help here. Please let us know if this new version resolves what you were seeing previously. Thank you!
